      <h2>About Menai Bay Conservation</h2>
      <div>Menai Bay Conservation Area encompasses the marine ecosystems off Fumba peninsula and the southwest coast, protecting coral reefs, seagrass beds, mangrove forests, and marine biodiversity. The area is famous for Safari Blue dhow excursions — traditional sailing trips to sandbanks and snorkeling sites — and responsible dolphin watching. Community-based management by local fishing villages ensures sustainable tourism and fishing practices. The $10 per adult marine fee (included in our Safari Blue price) funds ranger patrols, reef monitoring, and community development.</div>
